    "text": "<p>Match List I with List II.</p><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"width: 400px;\">\t<tbody>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"text-align: center;\">List I</td>\t\t\t<td colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"text-align: center;\">List II</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>A.</td>\t\t\t<td>van&#39;t Hoff<br />\t\t\tfactor, i</td>\t\t\t<td>I.</td>\t\t\t<td>Cryoscopic constant</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>B.</td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi></msub></math></td>\t\t\t<td>II.</td>\t\t\t<td>Isotonic solutions</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>C.</td>\t\t\t<td>Solutions with same osmotic pressure</td>\t\t\t<td>III.</td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mtext>Normal&#160;molar&#160;mass</mtext><mtext>Abnormal&#160;molar&#160;mas</mtext></mfrac></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>D.</td>\t\t\t<td>Azeotropes</td>\t\t\t<td>IV.</td>\t\t\t<td>Solutions with same composition of vapour above it</td>\t\t</tr>\t</tbody></table><p>Choose the correct answer from the options given below:</p>"
